msgid "6 Learn about data recording and playback"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:81
msgid ""
"Sometimes it's useful to replay data to reproduce the results of your tests "
"and experiments, to debug your robot's behaviour, or to share your work with "
"others."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/First-Steps.rst:83
msgid ""
